  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDWS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestinian Development Women Studies - PDWS.  The project &#x201c;Strengthening the role of Palestinian youth in decision-making and reconstruction&#x201d; will be implemented in a complex social, economic, and political context faced by the Palestinian community in the Gaza Strip and the northern areas.
The project will focus on enhancing the role of youth in decision-making related to reconstruction by building their capacities and developing their skills in areas such as preparing fact sheets, advocacy and lobbying, and legal awareness. The project also aims to improve the youth&#x2019;s ability to influence the social and economic levels through participation in improving community services and the social fabric in Gaza and the northern areas. These activities are crucial in addressing the multiple challenges faced by Palestinian youth, such as high unemployment rates, their underrepresentation in decision-making processes, and their lack of awareness of their legal rights and mechanisms for political participation.</narrative>
  </description>
